    "# Estimate Cropped Stack Size\n",
    "\n",
    "This step provides an approximate file size for the displacement stack based on the bounding box you drew earlier and the number of selected granules.\n",
    "\n",
    "It helps you:\n",
    "- Understand the size of the data you are about to download\n",
    "- Decide whether to reduce the area of interest to save space\n",
    "\n",
    "<font color=\"red\">Warning: If the estimated size is too large for your available storage (~50GB), consider reducing the bounding box before continuing.</font>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
