   "source": [
    "### Velocity Estimation\n",
    "\n",
    "This cell computes a linear velocity map (in cm/year) from the displacement time series using least squares fitting.\n",
    "- Fits a linear model: *displacement = velocity × time + intercept*.\n",
    "- Colors represent motion in the satellite's line-of-sight (LOS) direction  \n",
    "  - **Red** indicates motion **away** from the satellite  \n",
    "  - **Blue** indicates motion **toward** the satellite\n",
    "- The green dot marks the **reference point**, which has been set to zero displacement"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
     "height": 812
    },
    "id": "AI8igXPOuF8s",
    "outputId": "4564bac5-3b72-4751-f455-4f0ab45f5bfe"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1000x800 with 2 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "rate = compute_velocity_from_stack(stack_prod, displacement_var=\"displacement\")\n",
    "plot_displacement_map(stack_prod, meta, clicked_refe[-1], buffer_fraction=0.05, velocity= rate)"
