       "- **grid_mapping**: spatial_ref\n",
       "\n",
       "###  Layer: `phase_similarity`\n",
       "- **units**: unitless\n",
       "- **description**: Median cosine similarity of wrapped phase in each pixel's neighborhood.\n",
